# Financial App: Comprehensive Functionality Guide

This document provides a detailed overview of every core functionality available in the platform, categorized by system area and user role.

## 🛡️ Core Infrastructure & Security

| Feature | Description | Status |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Unified Authentication** | Secure Login/Registration via Email, Google Social Auth, and Apple ID. | ✅ Live |
| **Identity Verification** | OTP (One-Time Password) verification for registrations and password resets. | ✅ Live |
| **Multi-Role Access** | Role-based permissions for Clients, CAs (Chartered Accountants), Financial Planners (Analysts), and Admins. | ✅ Live |
| **Security Hardening** | JWT-based session management, CSRF protection, and 2FA (Two-Factor Authentication) toggle. | ✅ Live |
| **Theme & UX** | Glassmorphic UI with Dark/Light mode support and personalized user settings. | ✅ Live |

---

## 📊 Client Dashboard (Wealth Monitor)

The central hub for individual users to track their financial life.

*   **Real-time Net Worth**: Automated calculation of total wealth based on asset entries and uploads.
*   **Asset Allocation**: Dynamic pie chart visualization of wealth distribution (Bank, Equity, Cash, etc.).
*   **Activity Feed**: Audit trail of every action taken within the account for security and transparency.
*   **Consultation Hub**: Direct line to book and attend meetings with verified professionals.

---

## 🤖 Docs AI: Intelligent Document Management

A state-of-the-art document archival and analysis system.

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[Upload PDF/Image] --> B{AI Processor}
    B --> C[Metadata Extraction]
    B --> D[Text Embedding]
    D --> E[(RAG Knowledge Base)]
    C --> F[Professional Review]
```

*   **Multimodal Ingestion**: Supports PDFs, Images (OCR), and Text files.
*   **AI Extraction**: Automated parsing of key data from receipts, invoices, and contracts using LLMs (Groq/Llama).
*   **RAG Knowledge Base**: A "Chat with your Docs" feature allowing users to ask natural language questions about their uploaded files.
*   **Assignment Engine**: Route documents to your CA or Financial Planner for professional validation.
*   **Bulk Queue Management**: Special tools for professionals to clear dozens of pending documents efficiently.

---

## 📑 GST Workspace & Compliance

Tailored for business owners and CAs to manage tax compliance seamlessly.

*   **ITC Optimization**: Track Input Tax Credit records and identify optimization opportunities.
*   **HSN Intelligence**: Integrated HSN code lookup and categorization for accurate invoice creation.
*   **Filing Tracker**: Real-time status monitoring of GST filings (Submitted, Pending, Approved).
*   **Professional Reporting**: CAs can generate and transmit high-fidelity, customized GST performance reports directly to clients.

---

## 🧠 Fin-Plan: Decision Intelligence

The engine that powers smart financial choices.

*   **Structured Submissions**: Comprehensive forms for life-goal based financial planning.
*   **Automated Decision Packs**: AI-generated reports that score financial health and provide actionable signals.
*   **Card Intelligence**: A personalized recommendation engine that analyzes spending patterns to suggest the most rewarding Credit Cards.
*   **Analyst Feedback Loop**: Professionals can "Accept" or "Reject" AI signals to ensure human-in-the-loop accuracy (Truth Validation).

---

## 🔎 Analyst & MOAT (Decision Intelligence)

Dedicated tools for professional analysts to provide high-fidelity financial advice.

*   **Decision Pack Viewer**: Interactive dashboard for professionals to review AI-generated risk scores, income projections, and spending signals.
*   **Outcome Tracking**: A "Closed-Loop" feedback system where analysts record the final outcome of financial advice to improve future AI accuracy.
*   **Truth Validation**: Automated consistency checks between user-submitted data and extracted document evidence.
*   **Analyst Stats**: Performance tracking for professionals, including review counts, avg. response times, and consultation ratings.

---

## 🛠️ Global Platform Features

*   **Smart Notifications**: Real-time alerts for document status changes, meeting reminders, and new AI signals.
*   **Feedback System**: Integrated feedback loops for every major feature area to drive continuous improvement.
*   **Knowledge Base (FAQ)**: Built-in searchable help center for application navigation.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> All AI features leverage high-performance LLMs via Groq and OpenAI, ensuring sub-second response times for document queries and intelligence generation.
